rous endeavor to revive spectacular theatre single-handedly, his newspaper columns, the political activities into which he so passionately flung himself. And of course the films, as fascinating as they were flawed: The Magnificent Ambersons, Journey into Fear, The Stranger, The Lady from Shanghai. The thread that runs through all this apparently incoherent blur of inactivity is an often frustrated engagement with his native land, its faults, its dreams, its popular arts, its history. But by 1947, he had said all that he had to say to his fellow citizens; it was Goodbye Americans for two decades of endlessly experimental and innovative but essentially European work.\"--BOOK JACKET.","publicationYear":1995,"subjectCategories":[{"source":"open_library","scheme":"open_library_subject","label":"Biography","sourceId":"source-open-library-summary-orson-welles-the-road-to-xanadu-simon-callow"},{"source":"open_library","scheme":"open_library_subject","label":"Actors","sourceId":"source-open-library-summary-orson-welles-the-road-to-xanadu-simon-callow"},{"source":"open_library","scheme":"open_library_subject","label":"Motion picture producers and directors","sourceId":"source-open-library-summary-orson-welles-the-road-to-xanadu-simon-callow"},{"source":"open_library","scheme":"open_library_subject","label":"Motion pictureproducers and directors","sourceId":"source-open-library-summary-orson-welles-the-road-to-xanadu-simon-callow"},{"source":"open_library","scheme":"open_library_subject","label":"censrship","sourceId":"source-open-library-summary-orson-welles-the-road-to-xanadu-simon-callow"},{"source":"open_library","scheme":"open_library_subject","label":"Citizen Kane","sourceId":"source-open-library-summary-orson-welles-the-road-to-xanadu-simon-callow"},{"source":"open_library","scheme":"open_library_subject","label":"Actors, biography","sourceId":"source-open-library-summary-orson-welles-the-road-to-xanadu-simon-callow"},{"source":"open_library","scheme":"open_library_subj